`ProxyTunnelError` exposes the proxy status as `this.status`, but the linked issue expects a `statusCode` field. Consider renaming to `statusCode` (and keeping `status` as an alias if you want to avoid a breaking change).
```suggestion
        const statusCode = match ? Number(match[1]) : undefined;
        this.statusCode = statusCode;
        this.status = statusCode;
```

