body:
We currently do not check for the last point in the [RFC section](https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc6265/#section-5.1.3), i.e., `The string is a host name (i.e., not an IP address).`

Claude proposes an early return on 

```rust
if host.parse::<std::net::IpAddr>().is_ok() {
    return host == cookie_domain;
}
```

which imo sounds reasonable

